@startuml
title DanmakuStream 改造前单体部署图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "普通用户/创作者" as User
actor "审核员/管理员" as Admin
actor "直播主播\nOBS/推流工具" as Streamer

node "用户设备" as Client {
  artifact "Web Browser" as Browser
}

node "Docker Compose Host" as Host {
  node "frontend 容器\nNginx :80" as Frontend {
    artifact "Vue 3 静态资源" as Vue
    component "反向代理" as Proxy
  }

  node "backend 容器\nGo + Gin :8080" as Backend {
    component "单体业务应用" as Monolith
    component "JWT/角色中间件" as Auth
    component "REST API" as Rest
    component "WebSocket" as WS
    component "FFmpeg" as FFmpeg
  }

  database "mysql 容器\nMySQL 8.0 :3306" as MySQL

  node "srs 容器\nSRS 5" as SRS {
    component "RTMP :1935" as RTMP
    component "HTTP/HLS :8080\n宿主机映射 :8081" as HLS
  }

  folder "video_data 卷" as VideoData {
    artifact "视频/封面/头像/图片" as Media
  }

  folder "mysql_data 卷" as MySQLData
}

User --> Browser : 访问系统
Admin --> Browser : 访问管理后台
Browser --> Frontend : HTTP :80
Frontend --> Vue : 返回 HTML/CSS/JS
Proxy --> Backend : /api、/media、/ws\nHTTP/WebSocket :8080

Monolith --> MySQL : GORM / TCP :3306
MySQL --> MySQLData : 持久化
Monolith --> VideoData : 读写媒体文件
FFmpeg --> VideoData : 转码/截取封面

Streamer --> RTMP : 推送直播流 :1935
Browser --> HLS : 播放直播 :8081
Backend ..> SRS : 生成并返回\n推流/播放地址

note right of Backend
当前为一个 Go 单体后端：
身份、视频、互动、直播、
通知和后台管理均在同一进程
end note

@enduml